    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        D-Judge: Disrupting Multi-Turn <span class="search-hit mathjax">Jailbreaks</span> using Semantics-Preserving Output Rewriting
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gong%2C+H">Huanli Gong</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wei%2C+Z">Zhipeng Wei</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Fu%2C+Y">Yu Fu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Shahgir%2C+H+S">Haz Sameen Shahgir</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gupta%2C+A">Ananya Gupta</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Dong%2C+Y">Yue Dong</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Erichson%2C+N+B">N. Benjamin Erichson</a>
      
