        THRD: A Training-Free Multi-Turn Defense Framework for <span class="search-hit mathjax">Jailbreak</span> Attacks on Large Language Models
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ma%2C+Z">Zhiqing Ma</a>, 
      
