        PAST2HARM: A Simple Adaptive Past Tense Attack for <span class="search-hit mathjax">Jailbreaking</span> Multimodal AI
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Mukhopadhyay%2C+S">Snehasis Mukhopadhyay</a>
      
