        LASH: Adaptive Semantic Hybridization for Black-Box <span class="search-hit mathjax">Jailbreaking</span> of Large Language Models
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Nafi%2C+A+A+N">Abdullah Al Nomaan Nafi</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Suya%2C+F">Fnu Suya</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Bhunia%2C+S">Swarup Bhunia</a>, 
      
