        Multilingual <span class="search-hit mathjax">jailbreaking</span> of LLMs using low-resource languages
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Marx%2C+D">Dylan Marx</a>, 
      
